trinkets.effects:
* Grants a chance of increasing damage by 1.8 for the current room upon taking damage.
** The chance depends on the luck stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: ⟨15⟩ \frac1 { 5 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} \times 0.5\right \rfloor}
*** At 0 luck the chance is 20%, maxing out at 100% at ⟨15⟩ 8 / ⟨16⟩ 16 luck.

trinkets.notes:
* ⟨30⟩ Can be triggered upon clearing a wave in ⟦s:greed-mode¦Greed Mode⟧.
* The chance to be healed depends on the luck stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: \frac1 { 10 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} * 0.5 \right \rfloor}
** At base luck (0), the chance is 10%, maxing out at 100% at 18 luck.

trinkets.effects:
* When starting a floor, 25% chance to gain the effect of ⟦i:21¦The Compass⟧ for the duration of the floor.
** ⟨28⟩ The chance increases based on the Luck stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: \frac1 { 4 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} \right \rfloor}
*** At base luck (0), the chance is 25%, maxing out at 100% at 3 luck.

trinkets.notes:
* The chance to fire a tooth depends on the luck stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: \frac1 { 10 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} \right \rfloor}
** At base luck (0), the chance is 10%, maxing out at 100% at 9 luck.
* This trinket is identical in function to ⟦i:150¦Tough Love⟧, so all interactions with that item apply to this trinket as well.

